5 Years Experience DevOps Engineer ke interview me sirf command batana kaafi nahi hota. Interviewer dekhna chahta hai ki issue aane par aap kaunsi command kis order me chalate ho aur kyu chalate ho.
Scenario 1: Server Slow Hai
Step 1: Load Check
Bash
uptime
Output:
Bash
load average: 15.2 12.5 10.3
Agar server 4 CPU ka hai aur load 15 hai to system overloaded hai.
Step 2: CPU Check
Bash
top
Ya
Bash
ps -eo pid,ppid,%cpu,%mem,cmd --sort=-%cpu | head
Dekhenge kaunsa process CPU kha raha hai.
Step 3: Memory Check
Bash
free -h
Bash
vmstat 1 5
Swap use ho rahi hai ya nahi.
Step 4: Disk I/O Check
Bash
iostat -x 1 5
Agar %util 90-100% hai to disk bottleneck hai.
Scenario 2: Website Open Nahi Ho Rahi
Step 1 DNS
Bash
nslookup google.com
Ya
Bash
dig google.com
Step 2 Connectivity
Bash
ping google.com
Step 3 Port Reachability
Bash
nc -zv google.com 443
Ya
Bash
telnet google.com 443
Step 4 HTTP Response
Bash
curl -I https://google.com
Step 5 Service Status
Bash
systemctl status nginx
Step 6 Logs
Bash
journalctl -u nginx
