Commands Jo 5+ Years DevOps Engineer Ko Ratne Chahiye
Bash
Interview me agar interviewer bole:
"Website nahi chal rahi, troubleshoot karo"
To aapka flow hona chahiye:
DNS → Ping → Port → Service → Logs → Firewall → Application
Aur agar bole:
"Server slow hai"
To flow hona chahiye:
Load → CPU → Memory → Disk I/O → Network → Logs
Ye structured approach hi 5 years experienced DevOps engineer ko fresher se alag dikhati hai.

Agar aap 5 years experienced DevOps Engineer ke interview ki preparation kar rahe hain, to Linux/Ubuntu se related questions basic commands se aage jaakar troubleshooting, performance, networking aur administration par focus karte hain.
